	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Variables were required to have at least 85% completeness. Missing numerical values were imputed using medians and categorical values using the mode. The max-variable model used 2,092 donors and 61 predictors; the exact integer training and test counts resulting from the reported 80:20 random split were not stated. Expiration occurred in 59% and 82% of the max-variable cohort at 30 and 120 minutes, respectively, but no class weighting, resampling, or other explicit class-imbalance method was reported. A web application was provided, but source code or model weights were not reported.

